{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secure their name in fame and notoriety with the help of a motley crew of contractors that may or may not have your best interests in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alter your ship's equipment and internals to your liking and playstyle - or towards the needs of your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world and push the limits of where you're allowed to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>REGOLITH is still in its early development stages, and has a long way to go. Please be patient, I'm just one guy!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279270?t=1747411154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747411154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/b29473ee0199de96643630e5013e8aa5a706cb48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747411154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279270/b29473ee0199de96643630e5013e8aa5a706cb48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747411154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secure their name in fame and notoriety with the help of a motley crew of contractors that may or may 